  "headline": "Prabowo Expands Sekolah Rakyat Program To Combat National Poverty",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Expands Sekolah Rakyat Program",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo expands the Sekolah Rakyat program to support impoverished children through new counseling and mentorship initiatives nationwide.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo aims to establish 500 Sekolah Rakyat units as a strategic effort to break the cycle of poverty through education.",
    "The Ministry of Social Affairs and the Ministry of Development and Creative Economy have signed an MoU to integrate adolescent counseling into the program.",
    "Regional authorities, such as the Humbang Hasundutan Regency, are actively proposing new school sites by preparing land for development."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Sekolah Rakyat program is a government-led initiative championed by President Prabowo to provide educational opportunities for children from low-income families. Recently, the focus has shifted toward operational quality, with the Ministry of Social Affairs conducting extensive training for guardians and dormitory staff to ensure students receive empathetic support. Officials, including Minister of Social Affairs Saifullah Yusuf and Deputy Minister Agus Jabo, have emphasized the importance of fostering students' aspirations and emotional well-being. Meanwhile, regional expansion continues, with local governments like Humbang Hasundutan preparing six hectares of land for new facilities. These efforts aim to address the significant number of out-of-school youths in provinces like West Java, where local officials are urging mayors and regents to increase awareness and intervention. The initiative is positioned as a central pillar in the national agenda to alleviate poverty.",
